d 'XTIE2': module to provide Interactive Panel Data Estimation with automatic pairwise interactions
d
d  xtie2 estimates a fixed-effects panel model including all
d pairwise interactions among the explanatory variables. The first
d variable is treated as the dependent variable. The first two
d explanatory variables define the primary interaction used for
d marginal-effect analysis. The command reports the interaction
d coefficient, its standard error, t statistic and p value. It also
d calculates marginal effects and marginal-effect zero-crossing
d critical values. 
d
d KW: panel data
d KW: interactions
d KW: marginal effects
d
d Requires: Stata version 18
d
d Distribution-Date: 20260924
d
d Author:  Zehra Yalnız,   Kocaeli University, Türkiye
d Support: email zehrayalnizz41@@gmail.com
d
f xtie2.ado
f xtie2.sthlp
